    <briefdescription>
<para>This class implements -time-passes functionality for new pass manager. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It provides the pass-instrumentation callbacks that measure the pass execution time. They collect timing info into individual timers as passes are being run. At the end of its life-time it prints the resulting timing report. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
